_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按帝紀及百官表，成帝建始四年，初置尚書員五人。此蓋言顯與牢梁、五鹿充宗、伊嘉、陳順五人皆典領尚書事，雖未置定員，實亦五人也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按帝纪及百官表，成帝建始四年，初置尚书员五人。此盖言显与牢梁、五鹿充宗、伊嘉、陈顺五人皆典领尚书事，虽未置定员，实亦五人也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"918bba03-db0e-11ef-9bf7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918bba0e-db0e-11ef-8aa2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：瘖，音於今翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：瘖，音于今翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"918bba0d-db0e-11ef-8310-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"光祿大夫","official_note":"光祿大夫是漢代高級文官，負責顧問應對，此處周堪被任命為此職，顯示皇帝對他的信任和重用。","official_rank":"中二千石","source_snippet":"拜爲光祿大夫","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"a71fbd62-46fe-4f03-bf4a-0ea6acd1cb9e"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書事","official_note":"尚書事是掌管尚書台事務的職務，此處周堪兼任此職，但實際權力被中書令石顯控制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"領尚書事","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"d29ac64a-2c09-4094-809d-e75ff8e92bbb"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太中大夫","official_note":"太中大夫是漢代中級文官，負責議論朝政，此處張猛被重新任命為此職。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"猛復爲太中大夫","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"783721c3-8377-40e2-af55-1181587496f4"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"給事中","official_note":"給事中是漢代近臣，負責侍從皇帝、審核詔令，此處張猛兼任此職，顯示其親近皇帝的地位。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"給事中","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"b301e5b2-d690-4ac2-8f5b-3da9d35239d8"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"中書令","official_note":"中書令是漢代掌管中書機構的官員，負責傳達詔令，此處石顯擔任此職，控制尚書台，權力很大。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"中書令石顯管尚書","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"b9f4951f-8a12-4d04-9367-b8b6bbfc5391"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書","official_note":"尚書是漢代尚書台的官員，負責處理文書和政務，此處五人都是石顯的黨羽，顯示石顯對朝政的操控。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"尚書五人皆其黨也","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8a137c81-8d85-4b55-89c6-8eef44c4e254"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周堪","people_name_jianti_auto":"周堪","people_xingming":"周堪","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"918bba0f-db0e-11ef-83b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"张猛","people_xingming":"张猛","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"918bba10-db0e-11ef-b93f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堪","people_name_jianti_auto":"堪","people_xingming":"周堪","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"918bba11-db0e-11ef-be74-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"猛","people_xingming":"张猛","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"918bba12-db0e-11ef-bd7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"猛","people_xingming":"张猛","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"918bba13-db0e-11ef-a9e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-33,"link_td_description":"石显，字君房，是西汉时期的宦官，济南人（今属山东章丘）。汉元帝年间，石显趁汉元帝得病时专擅朝政，在其掌权期间大肆结党营私，打击异己。朝中重臣如周堪、刘更生等人皆因石显的缘故而被废官禁锢，帝师萧望之亦遭他陷害而自尽身亡。汉成帝继位后石显失势，被弹劾免官，死于回乡路途中。","link_td_id":"Q10010458","link_td_number_id":1055441,"people_name":"石顯","people_name_jianti_auto":"石显","people_xingming":"石显","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"918bba14-db0e-11ef-a639-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堪","people_name_jianti_auto":"堪","people_xingming":"周堪","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"918bba15-db0e-11ef-9f5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-33,"link_td_description":"石显，字君房，是西汉时期的宦官，济南人（今属山东章丘）。汉元帝年间，石显趁汉元帝得病时专擅朝政，在其掌权期间大肆结党营私，打击异己。朝中重臣如周堪、刘更生等人皆因石显的缘故而被废官禁锢，帝师萧望之亦遭他陷害而自尽身亡。汉成帝继位后石显失势，被弹劾免官，死于回乡路途中。","link_td_id":"Q10010458","link_td_number_id":1055441,"people_name":"顯","people_name_jianti_auto":"显","people_xingming":"石显","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"918bba16-db0e-11ef-99c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-33,"link_td_description":"石显，字君房，是西汉时期的宦官，济南人（今属山东章丘）。汉元帝年间，石显趁汉元帝得病时专擅朝政，在其掌权期间大肆结党营私，打击异己。朝中重臣如周堪、刘更生等人皆因石显的缘故而被废官禁锢，帝师萧望之亦遭他陷害而自尽身亡。汉成帝继位后石显失势，被弹劾免官，死于回乡路途中。","link_td_id":"Q10010458","link_td_number_id":1055441,"people_name":"顯","people_name_jianti_auto":"显","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"918bba17-db0e-11ef-8940-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堪","people_name_jianti_auto":"堪","people_xingming":"周堪","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"918bba18-db0e-11ef-bc43-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-33,"link_td_description":"石显，字君房，是西汉时期的宦官，济南人（今属山东章丘）。汉元帝年间，石显趁汉元帝得病时专擅朝政，在其掌权期间大肆结党营私，打击异己。朝中重臣如周堪、刘更生等人皆因石显的缘故而被废官禁锢，帝师萧望之亦遭他陷害而自尽身亡。汉成帝继位后石显失势，被弹劾免官，死于回乡路途中。","link_td_id":"Q10010458","link_td_number_id":1055441,"people_name":"顯","people_name_jianti_auto":"显","people_xingming":"石显","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"918bba19-db0e-11ef-8c05-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"猛","people_xingming":"张猛","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"918bba1a-db0e-11ef-b9cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"918bb9fa-db0e-11ef-bb95-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yīn","source_anchor_text":"口會堪疾瘖不能言而","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":117,"text":"瘖","tongjian_id":"203c46cf-6d21-5802-9e78-b970ebb6e649"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"4戊寅晦，日有食之。上於是召諸前言日變在周堪、張猛者責問，皆稽首謝；因下詔稱堪、猛之美，徵詣行在所，拜爲光祿大夫，秩中二千石，領尚書事；猛復爲太中大夫、給事中。中書令石顯管尚書，尚書五人皆其黨也；堪希得見，常因顯白事，事決顯口。會堪疾瘖，不能言而卒。顯誣譖猛，令自殺於公車。","content_fanyi":"戊寅晦日，出现日食。汉元帝于是召见此前声称日食灾变责任在周堪、张猛的人加以责问，这些人都叩头谢罪；于是下诏称赞周堪、张猛的美德，征召他们到京师长安行在，任命周堪为光禄大夫，俸禄中二千石，领尚书事；张猛又担任太中大夫、给事中。中书令石显掌管尚书事务，尚书五人都是他的党羽；周堪很少能见到皇上，常常要经由石显禀报事务，事情都由石显口头决断。适逢周堪患上失音之症，不能说话而去世。石显诬陷张猛，逼令他在公车官署自杀。","content_jianti_auto":"4戊寅晦，日有食之。上于是召诸前言日变在周堪、张猛者责问，皆稽首谢；因下诏称堪、猛之美，征诣行在所，拜为光禄大夫，秩中二千石，领尚书事；猛复为太中大夫、给事中。中书令石显管尚书，尚书五人皆其党也；堪希得见，常因显白事，事决显口。会堪疾瘖，不能言而卒。显诬谮猛，令自杀于公车。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，咎元帝而因以咎禹、衡。乃石显之奸恶不及于天下，而海内晏...","context_before":"论者徒见","source_end_index":15,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bb2aa1bf-72fb-457a-a4f0-a91a63c619c7","source_start_index":4,"source_text":"萧望之、周堪之死不以罪"}],"title":"四 贡禹匡衡以学事君"}],"id":2262,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"918bb9fa-db0e-11ef-bb95-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋玄成","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦玄成","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"918bba1d-db0e-11ef-98fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"918bba1e-db0e-11ef-9535-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝惠","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝惠","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"918bba1f-db0e-11ef-bd2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝景","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝景","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"918bba20-db0e-11ef-b0b4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"918bba21-db0e-11ef-ad17-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"悼考廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"悼考庙","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"918bba22-db0e-11ef-bc2e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按貢禹傳，定漢宗廟迭毀之禮，未及施行而卒。其後，韋玄成等毀廟之議，又不純用禹說。觀其奏言天子七廟，孝惠、孝景親盡宜毀，蓋以悼考廟足爲七廟也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按贡禹传，定汉宗庙迭毁之礼，未及施行而卒。其后，韦玄成等毁庙之议，又不纯用禹说。观其奏言天子七庙，孝惠、孝景亲尽宜毁，盖以悼考庙足为七庙也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"918bba1c-db0e-11ef-9075-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"惠帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918bba25-db0e-11ef-85dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"918bba26-db0e-11ef-8ce4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣帝","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"918bba27-db0e-11ef-aeca-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"918bba28-db0e-11ef-a00a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高帝廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"高帝庙","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"918bba29-db0e-11ef-af3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太祖廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"太祖庙","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"918bba2a-db0e-11ef-a122-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"文帝廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"文帝庙","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"918bba2b-db0e-11ef-ad56-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太宗廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"太宗庙","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"918bba2c-db0e-11ef-97fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太祖","place_name_jianti_auto":"太祖","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"918bba2d-db0e-11ef-8ac1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太宗廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"太宗庙","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"918bba2e-db0e-11ef-ae23-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"世宗廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"世宗庙","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"918bba2f-db0e-11ef-b78c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"惠帝尊高帝廟爲太祖廟，景帝尊文帝廟爲太宗廟；行所嘗幸郡國，各立太祖、太宗廟。宣帝復尊武帝爲世宗廟，行所巡狩亦立焉。凡祖宗廟在郡國者六十八，合百六十七所。春秋之義，王不祭於下土諸侯，故以爲不應古禮。","note_content_jianti_auto":"惠帝尊高帝庙为太祖庙，景帝尊文帝庙为太宗庙；行所尝幸郡国，各立太祖、太宗庙。宣帝复尊武帝为世宗庙，行所巡狩亦立焉。凡祖宗庙在郡国者六十八，合百六十七所。春秋之义，王不祭于下土诸侯，故以为不应古礼。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"918bba24-db0e-11ef-a1f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918bba32-db0e-11ef-8b64-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭靈后","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭灵后","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"918bba33-db0e-11ef-b94a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"918bba34-db0e-11ef-bc78-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武哀王","people_name_jianti_auto":"武哀王","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"918bba35-db0e-11ef-8480-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"918bba36-db0e-11ef-8092-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭哀后","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭哀后","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"918bba37-db0e-11ef-95a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"918bba38-db0e-11ef-8441-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞思后","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞思后","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"918bba39-db0e-11ef-a243-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"戾太子","people_name_jianti_auto":"戾太子","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"918bba3a-db0e-11ef-be65-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"戾后","people_name_jianti_auto":"戾后","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"918bba3b-db0e-11ef-a8c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"史良娣","people_name_jianti_auto":"史良娣","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"918bba3c-db0e-11ef-a623-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：昭靈后，高祖母也。武哀王，高祖兄也。昭哀后，高祖姊也。衞思后，戾太子母也。戾后，卽史良娣也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：昭灵后，高祖母也。武哀王，高祖兄也。昭哀后，高祖姊也。衞思后，戾太子母也。戾后，即史良娣也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"918bba31-db0e-11ef-aa5e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-124,"link_death_year":-44,"link_td_description":"贡禹，西汉中期大臣。字少翁，琅琊郡（今山东诸城）人。他在汉宣帝时，任谏大夫。他多次上书汉元帝，针对朝廷腐败、贵族奢侈、郡县人民贫困，建议皇帝选贤任能、诛杀奸臣，重视节俭、减轻徭役。初元五年（前44年）六月，代陈万年为御史大夫，十二月去世，薛广德继任。","link_td_id":"Q10013054","link_td_number_id":1551696,"people_name":"貢禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"贡禹","people_xingming":"贡禹","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"918bba3d-db0e-11ef-89c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-211,"link_death_year":-188,"link_td_description":"汉惠帝刘盈，汉朝开国皇帝汉高帝刘邦和皇后吕氏之子，汉朝皇帝，于前195年6月26日—前188年9月26日在位，在位7年，其正式谥号为“孝惠皇帝”。","link_td_id":"Q10000195","link_td_number_id":106737,"people_name":"孝惠","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝惠","people_xingming":"刘盈","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"918bba3e-db0e-11ef-861c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘盈]"},{"link_birth_year":-188,"link_death_year":-141,"link_td_description":"汉景帝刘启，为汉朝皇帝（前157年7月14日－前141年3月9日在位），在位16年，享年48岁，其正式谥号为「孝景皇帝」，后世省略「孝」字称「汉景帝」。为汉文帝刘恒长子，母窦皇后。他在位期间，主要是削诸侯封地，平定七国之乱，巩固中央集权，勤俭治国，发展生产，他和其父亲文帝的统治时期合称文景之治，为中国自大一统以来的首个太平盛世。","link_td_id":"Q10000365","link_td_number_id":90408,"people_name":"孝景","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝景","people_xingming":"刘启","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"918bba3f-db0e-11ef-8d36-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘启]"},{"link_td_description":"刘媪，史称刘媪，一说王含始，汉初太上皇刘太公之妻，汉高祖刘邦之母，在汉朝创立时已故。","link_td_id":"Q10002501","link_td_number_id":1308908,"people_name":"昭靈后","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭灵后","people_xingming":"王含始","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"918bba40-db0e-11ef-b6b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武哀王","people_name_jianti_auto":"武哀王","people_xingming":"null","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"918bba41-db0e-11ef-8396-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭哀后","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭哀后","people_xingming":"null","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"918bba42-db0e-11ef-a839-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-91,"link_td_description":"卫子夫，汉代平阳（今山西临汾）人，汉武帝第二任皇后，卫青的同母异父姐姐，霍去病的姨母，戾太子刘据的母亲，汉宣帝的曾祖母。","link_td_id":"Q10000909","link_td_number_id":434102,"people_name":"衞思后","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞思后","people_xingming":"卫子夫","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"918bba43-db0e-11ef-9d54-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-128,"link_death_year":-91,"link_td_description":"刘据，西汉太子，汉武帝和皇后卫子夫的嫡长子，在巫蛊之祸中受到誣陷試圖抵抗，战败逃亡被围自杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000478","link_td_number_id":244067,"people_name":"戾太子","people_name_jianti_auto":"戾太子","people_xingming":"刘据","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"918bba44-db0e-11ef-a6d2-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘据]"},{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-91,"link_td_description":"史良娣，名不详，汉武帝时卫太子刘据的妾室，汉宣帝的祖母。","link_td_id":"Q10003597","link_td_number_id":1302102,"people_name":"戾后","people_name_jianti_auto":"戾后","people_xingming":"史良娣","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"918bba45-db0e-11ef-8812-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/匡衡守正","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后乃下诏先罢郡国庙，其亲尽寝园，皆无复修。已而上寝疾，梦...","context_before":"","source_end_index":49,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1d741831-296a-4273-b6fa-0d7aa7f147b5","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"汉元帝时，贡禹奏言：天子七庙，亲尽之庙宜毁，及郡国庙不应古礼，宜正定。天子下其议，未及施行而禹卒。"},{"context_after":"已而上寝疾，梦祖宗谴罢郡国庙。诏问丞相匡衡，议欲复之。衡...","context_before":"...，及郡国庙不应古礼，宜正定。天子下其议，未及施行而禹卒。","source_end_index":70,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1d741831-296a-4273-b6fa-0d7aa7f147b5","source_start_index":49,"source_text":"后乃下诏先罢郡国庙，其亲尽寝园，皆无复修。"}],"path":"四笔/卷一/匡衡守正","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5初，貢禹奏言：「孝惠、孝景廟皆親盡宜毀，及郡國廟不應古禮，宜正定。」天子是其議。秋，七月，戊子，罷昭靈后、武哀王、昭哀后、衞思后、戾太子、戾后園，皆不奉祠，裁置吏卒守焉。冬，十月，乙丑，罷祖宗廟在郡國者。","content_fanyi":"当初，贡禹上奏说：“孝惠帝、孝景帝的祭庙都因亲情已尽，应当撤除；郡国所设祭庙不符合古代礼制，也应予以纠正。”天子认为他的意见正确。秋季，七月戊子日，撤除昭灵后、武哀王、昭哀后、卫思后、戾太子、戾后的陵园，都不再举行祭祀，只酌量设置吏卒看守。冬季，十月乙丑日，撤除设在各郡国的祖宗祭庙。","content_jianti_auto":"5初，贡禹奏言：「孝惠、孝景庙皆亲尽宜毁，及郡国庙不应古礼，宜正定。」天子是其议。秋，七月，戊子，罢昭灵后、武哀王、昭哀后、衞思后、戾太子、戾后园，皆不奉祠，裁置吏卒守焉。冬，十月，乙丑，罢祖宗庙在郡国者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2263,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"918bba1b-db0e-11ef-ba0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91